This package contains ReadOS-authored deterministic command implementations over
msp-backend's virtual workspace contract. The implementation is an authored
adaptation informed by public MSP specifications and conformance descriptions;
it does not include raw MSP source and does not depend on the MSP repository,
native core, FFI, managed runtime, host filesystem, process APIs, or environment.

